WEBVTT

00:27.160 --> 00:30.560
♪Peach blossoms fall,
yesterday's trace fades away♪

00:30.800 --> 00:34.080
♪Ahead lie storms and winds,
our fates like drifting clouds sway♪

00:34.400 --> 00:40.040
♪Alas, I roam through what remains,
fate's grip won't set me free♪

00:41.400 --> 00:44.920
♪If time would spare me
just one breath to stay♪

00:45.520 --> 00:48.920
♪If you could see
the depth of my belief♪

00:49.120 --> 00:55.680
♪Alone I enter the game,
every move made with no regret in me♪

00:56.080 --> 01:00.040
♪Though shackles bind my soul
and chain my form♪

01:00.160 --> 01:03.240
♪I've walked
through life and death before♪

01:03.320 --> 01:10.200
♪I fear not fate's cruel temptations,
I've severed every cause♪

01:10.400 --> 01:14.440
♪In this life our threads entwined,
in love and pain we crossed♪

01:14.600 --> 01:17.480
♪But I'll keep my word
no matter the cost♪

01:17.560 --> 01:19.960
♪Forged in stardust and flame♪

01:20.040 --> 01:25.800
♪I rise with an unyielding frame♪

01:35.120 --> 01:36.960
=The Princess's Gambit=

01:37.040 --> 01:39.440
(Adapted from the novel "Peach Blossoms
Reflecting the River and Mountains")

01:39.520 --> 01:42.000
(by Bai Lu Cheng Shuang)

01:42.160 --> 01:44.920
=Episode 33=

01:47.520 --> 01:49.200
That's not the daughter
of the Meng family.

01:49.920 --> 01:50.760
Who is she, then?

01:50.840 --> 01:52.440
Please explain yourself, Prince Wuyin.

01:55.240 --> 01:57.960
She is Empress Lv of Beiyuan.

01:58.880 --> 01:59.480
Empress Lv?

01:59.560 --> 02:00.640
- Empress Lv?
- Empress Lv?

02:00.960 --> 02:01.760
Absurd.

02:02.680 --> 02:03.680
Utterly absurd!

02:04.320 --> 02:06.200
Since Your Highness
has accepted the throne,

02:06.640 --> 02:07.480
how could Empress Lv

02:07.560 --> 02:09.440
become our Empress of Qi?

02:10.080 --> 02:10.800
Your Highness,

02:11.320 --> 02:13.080
you owe us an explanation.

02:13.160 --> 02:14.320
- Yes!
- That's right!

02:14.400 --> 02:15.680
Give us an explanation!

02:15.920 --> 02:16.720
We demand answers!

02:16.800 --> 02:17.760
Tell us what's going on!

02:17.840 --> 02:19.560
Yeah, give us an explanation!

02:21.120 --> 02:22.520
That's right!
Give us an explanation!

02:22.600 --> 02:23.520
We want answers!

02:23.640 --> 02:26.520
- You owe us a proper explanation!
- You owe us a proper explanation!

02:27.120 --> 02:28.040
So what if she isn't?

02:28.920 --> 02:29.960
And what if she is?

02:33.200 --> 02:35.360
No matter who Hua was in the past,

02:36.200 --> 02:37.240
from this day forward,

02:38.880 --> 02:40.480
she is my one and only wife.

02:43.120 --> 02:44.640
She is the Empress of Qi.

02:45.320 --> 02:46.760
Empress Lv poisoned her rivals,

02:46.880 --> 02:47.880
framed the innocent,

02:48.520 --> 02:49.280
and even bathed

02:49.360 --> 02:50.640
the borderlands in blood.

02:50.800 --> 02:51.840
She brought misery to all.

02:52.440 --> 02:54.080
She is a vile and monstrous person.

02:54.520 --> 02:55.960
Yet, you say her past

02:56.320 --> 02:57.320
doesn't matter?

02:59.880 --> 03:01.680
How dare you slander Hua?

03:02.560 --> 03:03.160
Guards!

03:04.440 --> 03:05.040
Kill her.

03:05.120 --> 03:06.040
- Yes, sir!
- Yes, sir!

03:19.080 --> 03:19.680
Wait!

03:22.360 --> 03:23.880
Allow me to interject.

03:24.760 --> 03:26.720
Your Highness once
proclaimed to the world

03:26.800 --> 03:29.240
that you'd marry the legitimate
daughter of the Meng family.

03:29.640 --> 03:31.880
And now you're marrying
Empress Lv of Beiyuan?

03:33.680 --> 03:35.400
On behalf of all my colleagues,

03:35.840 --> 03:38.120
I ask Your Highness
to explain this to us.

03:39.320 --> 03:42.000
- Yes, explain it to us!
- We want an explanation!

03:42.520 --> 03:43.320
Explanation?

03:44.360 --> 03:47.080
Today is the day I ascend
the throne and get married.

03:47.760 --> 03:49.720
And on the very first day,
you demand answers?

03:51.600 --> 03:53.320
What about the days that follow?

03:53.680 --> 03:54.840
Do you plan to take this throne

03:54.920 --> 03:55.960
and sit on it yourselves?

03:57.480 --> 03:59.600
Your Highness,
don't twist our intentions.

04:00.280 --> 04:02.080
Regardless of her identity,

04:02.920 --> 04:04.560
just judging by her age,

04:04.880 --> 04:06.120
she's not a proper match.

04:06.880 --> 04:08.160
Both sentimentally and logically,

04:09.120 --> 04:11.600
Your Highness owes us some explanation.

04:11.920 --> 04:12.800
- That's right.
- Yeah!

04:12.880 --> 04:13.800
- He's right!
- Exactly.

04:20.680 --> 04:22.520
Everyone, stop pressuring His Highness.

04:23.440 --> 04:24.800
His relationship with Empress Lv

04:24.880 --> 04:26.280
didn't start overnight.

04:27.320 --> 04:29.880
Empress Lv was once
a palace maid in Qi,

04:30.680 --> 04:32.320
and she looked after His Highness.

04:32.960 --> 04:34.960
It's only natural
that he grew attached to her.

04:35.280 --> 04:36.080
That makes sense.

04:37.560 --> 04:38.320
Moreover,

04:38.680 --> 04:40.720
His Highness has risen
from a carefree noble

04:41.000 --> 04:42.240
to where he is today.

04:42.800 --> 04:44.520
It only happened with her help.

04:44.880 --> 04:46.520
She used poison to control His Majesty,

04:47.040 --> 04:48.040
killed Prince Wuhen,

04:48.120 --> 04:49.320
framed Prince Wuxia,

04:50.200 --> 04:51.880
and even caused
Prince Wugou's downfall.

04:52.280 --> 04:53.520
His Highness couldn't have

04:54.080 --> 04:55.560
done all of that

04:55.840 --> 04:56.760
by himself.

04:58.680 --> 04:59.280
This is…

04:59.520 --> 05:00.760
Utterly shameless!

05:01.560 --> 05:03.680
Such heinous and immoral acts

05:04.040 --> 05:05.520
happened in Qi!

05:06.840 --> 05:09.040
I object to this marriage!

05:09.120 --> 05:10.200
- We object!
- That's right!

05:10.280 --> 05:11.120
- Exactly!
- Absolutely!

05:11.200 --> 05:12.120
- Yes!
- We won't agree!

05:12.200 --> 05:13.440
- Absolutely not!
- Absolutely not!

05:13.520 --> 05:14.920
- I object too!
- I object as well!

05:15.000 --> 05:16.360
- We all object!
- We won't accept this!

05:16.440 --> 05:17.040
We object!

05:17.120 --> 05:18.160
- We won't agree!
- We all object!

05:18.240 --> 05:19.280
- Absolutely not!
- No way!

05:21.280 --> 05:21.920
You object.

05:23.800 --> 05:24.400
Fine.

05:25.640 --> 05:26.880
Well said.

05:29.880 --> 05:31.000
In that case,

05:32.320 --> 05:34.160
I'd like to see

05:35.520 --> 05:38.000
how long a bunch of stubborn old fools

05:40.600 --> 05:42.520
can hold out.

05:44.120 --> 05:44.760
You…

05:51.280 --> 05:52.040
Object?

06:00.640 --> 06:01.720
Still want an explanation?

06:04.320 --> 06:05.600
How about now?

06:19.600 --> 06:20.280
Zhi!

06:22.720 --> 06:23.320
Ms. Zhenzhen.

06:24.720 --> 06:26.520
Zhi, open the palace gate now!

06:26.720 --> 06:28.120
Ms. Zhenzhen, you mustn't go.

06:28.520 --> 06:31.120
(Meng Zhi of the Meng Family)
Shen Zaiye has led General Zhou Chonghu

06:31.200 --> 06:32.200
through the west city gate.

06:32.280 --> 06:33.240
They'll be here any moment!

06:33.320 --> 06:35.480
If you open the gate now,
everything will be for nothing!

06:35.560 --> 06:39.120
Meng Zhi. The family leader's seal.
It carries the authority.

06:40.800 --> 06:43.240
Prince Wuyin ordered me

06:43.320 --> 06:45.560
to go to Qingxiu Hall
and guard His Majesty tomorrow.

06:47.040 --> 06:49.120
Father, you seem concerned.

06:51.640 --> 06:52.400
Tomorrow

06:53.160 --> 06:54.400
is the abdication ceremony,

06:54.920 --> 06:56.040
and your wedding day.

06:56.880 --> 06:58.120
If I'm not in the palace,

06:59.080 --> 07:01.800
I'll surely feel uneasy.

07:02.880 --> 07:04.880
So I give this seal to you.

07:05.720 --> 07:06.880
Once you're in the palace,

07:07.120 --> 07:09.240
you can use it to contact Meng Zhi

07:09.800 --> 07:10.800
as needed.

07:13.240 --> 07:14.120
Open the palace gate!

07:14.280 --> 07:14.880
Yes.

07:15.640 --> 07:16.280
Open the gate!

07:18.680 --> 07:19.320
How dare you!

07:25.280 --> 07:26.880
Who gave you permission?

07:28.360 --> 07:29.200
Greetings, Commander.

07:30.040 --> 07:30.840
Vice Commander Meng.

07:31.720 --> 07:33.520
Who told you to open the gate?

07:35.680 --> 07:37.520
General Qi just issued the order.

07:37.880 --> 07:39.120
We are to strengthen the defense

07:40.000 --> 07:41.760
until Prince Wuyin takes the throne.

07:44.040 --> 07:44.640
Guards.

07:45.200 --> 07:46.120
Seize Meng Zhi!

07:46.520 --> 07:47.120
Yes, sir!

07:47.800 --> 07:48.720
Kill him.

08:04.840 --> 08:05.880
Anyone else object?

08:25.560 --> 08:26.800
(It's gone on for too long.)

08:27.520 --> 08:28.960
(I don't know the situation outside.)

08:30.760 --> 08:32.280
(If I wait for him to take the throne,)

08:33.280 --> 08:34.280
(it'll be too late.)

08:35.320 --> 08:36.120
(Shen Zaiye…)

08:36.760 --> 08:37.880
(You'd better hurry.)

08:40.760 --> 08:41.880
Present the seal!

08:44.520 --> 08:46.520
Who said I was abdicating?

08:54.040 --> 08:54.920
Seize Jiang Taohua!

09:01.600 --> 09:02.960
Princess Chengping is in my hands.

09:03.520 --> 09:04.760
Shen Zaiye, back off!

09:10.080 --> 09:12.160
How dare you, traitor Mu Wuyin!

09:13.200 --> 09:14.480
You imprisoned the ruler,

09:14.840 --> 09:16.080
and plotted to usurp the throne!

09:16.880 --> 09:18.520
Your treachery deserves death!

09:19.320 --> 09:20.080
- Yes!
- Yes!

09:20.640 --> 09:21.280
Stop them!

09:23.160 --> 09:25.840
Those who conspired
with the traitor Mu Wuyin

09:26.600 --> 09:28.200
shall have their
whole families executed.

09:29.600 --> 09:31.080
But if you surrender now,

09:31.600 --> 09:32.680
you may be spared.

09:33.280 --> 09:34.320
All soldiers, listen up!

09:34.400 --> 09:35.560
Capture the traitors!

09:42.840 --> 09:44.080
If you surrender now,

09:44.920 --> 09:46.920
His Majesty will show mercy!

09:48.080 --> 09:48.680
Stand down!

09:49.280 --> 09:51.480
- Stand down!
- Stand down!

10:02.680 --> 10:03.800
I admit my crimes.

10:09.440 --> 10:10.080
Are you alright?

10:19.920 --> 10:20.600
They fled.

10:26.480 --> 10:27.080
Follow me.

10:32.680 --> 10:36.520
(Chongde Palace)

10:42.720 --> 10:43.320
Hua.

10:44.000 --> 10:44.600
Go now!

10:56.320 --> 10:56.920
Your Highness.

11:04.440 --> 11:05.520
Now that all's lost,

11:06.720 --> 11:07.520
how will you escape?

11:08.240 --> 11:09.080
If you can't leave,

11:10.000 --> 11:11.960
I still have hidden spies
left in Yujing.

11:12.800 --> 11:13.400
Maybe

11:14.400 --> 11:15.280
we could start over.

11:16.800 --> 11:18.400
I've already wiped out all your people.

11:23.520 --> 11:24.720
There are no spies

11:25.840 --> 11:26.720
to help us start over.

11:28.400 --> 11:29.720
A sly rabbit makes three burrows.

11:31.080 --> 11:31.960
Why would I place

11:32.600 --> 11:33.800
all my agents in Lan Boutique?

11:35.360 --> 11:36.160
If that's true,

11:38.320 --> 11:39.320
how could you

11:40.720 --> 11:42.080
have stayed by my side for so long?

11:45.560 --> 11:46.720
The situation is dire.

11:47.200 --> 11:50.600
Even if you don't trust me,
we can't just sit here and wait it out.

11:54.520 --> 11:55.120
Hua.

11:57.360 --> 11:58.720
We won't make it out.

11:59.840 --> 12:01.280
Father will never forgive me.

12:02.680 --> 12:04.760
Shen Zaiye and the others
will be here soon.

12:07.920 --> 12:08.720
I can't accept this.

12:09.840 --> 12:11.280
Why should I die here with you?

12:14.000 --> 12:14.600
Hua.

12:16.720 --> 12:18.240
Do you recognize this place?

12:20.280 --> 12:20.880
This is

12:21.920 --> 12:23.080
the grave

12:24.720 --> 12:26.320
I chose for us.

12:35.880 --> 12:36.960
See that bed?

12:39.040 --> 12:39.920
When I was little,

12:41.600 --> 12:43.160
you used to lull me to sleep there.

12:45.840 --> 12:46.520
And over there.

12:48.440 --> 12:49.240
Back then,

12:50.960 --> 12:52.880
we used to sing nursery rhymes together.

12:56.840 --> 12:57.720
All these years,

12:59.960 --> 13:01.360
I've maintained everything

13:03.200 --> 13:04.720
with great care.

13:08.800 --> 13:09.400
Hua.

13:13.200 --> 13:14.000
You know,

13:15.600 --> 13:16.200
this place

13:18.680 --> 13:20.640
was once where I felt happiest.

13:25.640 --> 13:26.560
But…

13:29.920 --> 13:31.280
It's the place I hate the most.

13:36.640 --> 13:38.440
Every single day I spent here

13:39.480 --> 13:40.480
was worse than death.

13:42.600 --> 13:43.320
And you…

13:46.520 --> 13:47.800
You are the person I hate most.

13:54.040 --> 13:55.440
All I ever wanted was to live

13:55.520 --> 13:56.600
quietly as a lowly maid.

13:58.280 --> 14:00.080
But you made me everyone's target,

14:00.840 --> 14:02.800
forcing me to endure
humiliation day after day.

14:05.520 --> 14:07.200
I finally escaped.

14:08.800 --> 14:10.080
I could've achieved great things.

14:11.640 --> 14:12.880
But because of the fool you were,

14:12.960 --> 14:14.000
I failed again and again.

14:14.400 --> 14:16.400
You even dragged me
back to Qi on your own whim,

14:17.680 --> 14:19.960
dreaming of offering
the world as a betrothal gift.

14:21.920 --> 14:22.920
What a joke.

14:25.440 --> 14:27.080
All of this was thanks to you.

14:30.640 --> 14:32.120
Now, I have nothing left.

14:34.440 --> 14:35.800
I'll never stay by your side.

14:37.960 --> 14:38.560
Hua.

14:40.840 --> 14:41.440
I'm sorry.

14:42.760 --> 14:44.200
Please don't leave me.

14:46.080 --> 14:47.360
You're all I have left.

15:05.120 --> 15:05.920
Stay!

15:35.720 --> 15:36.680
You want to kill me?

15:43.480 --> 15:44.080
Go ahead!

15:50.000 --> 15:50.640
Kill me!

16:19.800 --> 16:21.160
Just like when you were a kid.

16:22.640 --> 16:24.200
You've always been this pathetic.

16:47.080 --> 16:47.920
Hua…

16:49.080 --> 16:49.760
Hua…

16:59.000 --> 16:59.720
Hua…

17:08.319 --> 17:09.040
Hua…

17:10.240 --> 17:11.000
Hua…

17:12.280 --> 17:13.000
Hua…

17:24.000 --> 17:25.520
(You wanted the empire.)

17:27.040 --> 17:29.080
(I did everything I could
to make it happen.)

17:30.840 --> 17:32.440
(You feared my brother's power.)

17:33.920 --> 17:35.960
(I even turned against him to help you.)

17:37.840 --> 17:39.200
(You used me like a pawn.)

17:40.520 --> 17:42.520
(I willingly did your bidding.)

17:44.640 --> 17:45.520
(Hua…)

17:47.280 --> 17:49.640
(I gave you the glory you wanted.)

17:59.520 --> 18:01.560
(And today, it all goes up in flames.)

18:03.200 --> 18:04.720
(In this life or the next,)

18:07.120 --> 18:09.720
(you'll always owe me
for breaking my heart.)

18:38.320 --> 18:38.920
Empress Lv

18:40.680 --> 18:41.720
is actually dead.

18:43.960 --> 18:45.520
She met Mu Wuyin here,

18:46.640 --> 18:48.400
and died with him in the fire.

18:49.360 --> 18:51.400
I guess they met the same end.

18:52.520 --> 18:53.760
She killed my mother.

18:55.520 --> 18:57.280
She got Changjue trapped in the army.

18:58.920 --> 19:00.280
She drove me from my home.

19:02.120 --> 19:03.200
All these years,

19:04.320 --> 19:05.760
I've hated her every single day.

19:07.920 --> 19:08.760
And yet now,

19:10.320 --> 19:11.920
seeing her die in this inferno

19:14.400 --> 19:15.600
doesn't give me closure.

19:19.200 --> 19:20.240
Now that she's dead,

19:21.680 --> 19:22.520
everything is over.

19:24.360 --> 19:26.080
Someone I've hated for over a decade

19:27.920 --> 19:29.680
suddenly dies at someone else's hands.

19:31.800 --> 19:33.000
The hatred lingers on,

19:35.320 --> 19:37.200
yet there's no one left to hate.

19:38.840 --> 19:39.680
Do you know

19:41.160 --> 19:41.880
how that feels?

19:44.960 --> 19:45.600
Soon,

19:46.160 --> 19:47.080
I will.

19:57.960 --> 19:58.560
Zaiye!

20:02.960 --> 20:03.920
Are you hurt?

20:04.480 --> 20:05.080
We're alright.

20:10.320 --> 20:11.320
Is Wuyin…

20:12.720 --> 20:14.120
He and Empress Lv died in the flame.

20:16.040 --> 20:17.480
I wonder if Wuyin ever regretted

20:18.520 --> 20:20.320
what he had done in his final moments.

20:21.160 --> 20:22.120
He's done great evils.

20:23.000 --> 20:23.920
He brought ruin to all.

20:24.800 --> 20:27.680
All of this became his undoing.

20:53.480 --> 20:54.280
Bad news! Bad news!

20:54.480 --> 20:55.280
Fire in the palace!

20:55.840 --> 20:57.280
Go put it out!

20:57.600 --> 20:59.360
Empress Lv and Prince Wuyin
died in the fire!

20:59.520 --> 21:01.160
You two stay here.
The rest, come with me!

21:01.240 --> 21:01.920
- Yes, sir!
- Yes!

21:07.400 --> 21:09.240
Who did you just say died in the fire?

21:10.400 --> 21:12.400
Answer me! Who was it?

21:12.600 --> 21:13.800
We didn't go in ourselves.

21:14.080 --> 21:15.000
Let me go in!

21:15.080 --> 21:15.680
You mustn't.

21:16.400 --> 21:18.520
At least tell me who it was!

21:19.280 --> 21:19.880
Qingying!

21:26.240 --> 21:27.520
- Your Highness.
- Your Highness.

21:43.480 --> 21:44.520
What happened to your hand?

21:45.880 --> 21:47.320
It's nothing. Just a scratch.

21:48.120 --> 21:49.360
You're bleeding so badly.

21:50.320 --> 21:51.840
How is this nothing?

21:52.920 --> 21:53.760
Really, it's nothing.

21:57.400 --> 21:58.040
Qingying…

22:00.320 --> 22:01.000
Please don't cry.

22:02.920 --> 22:03.680
Look at you.

22:04.320 --> 22:06.160
You got this hurt
because I wasn't there.

22:07.520 --> 22:08.480
You know…

22:09.400 --> 22:10.920
When I woke up at the residence,

22:11.480 --> 22:13.120
there wasn't a single person around.

22:14.920 --> 22:16.560
No one told me anything.

22:17.680 --> 22:18.960
I felt like a complete outsider.

22:21.640 --> 22:22.440
I felt so helpless.

22:26.000 --> 22:26.600
Qingying…

22:30.000 --> 22:30.680
Qingying, you…

22:34.760 --> 22:35.960
Please stop crying, will you?

22:37.920 --> 22:38.520
Qingying…

22:40.200 --> 22:41.600
Aren't you always pushing me away?

22:41.840 --> 22:43.200
Why are you holding my hand now?

22:45.000 --> 22:45.880
Did I hurt you?

22:46.000 --> 22:46.600
Let me see.

22:49.160 --> 22:49.880
I promise you

22:50.880 --> 22:52.320
I'll never push you away again.

22:57.680 --> 22:58.280
Qingying…

22:59.600 --> 23:01.120
I want to keep you by my side forever.

23:03.680 --> 23:04.520
What did you say?

23:07.400 --> 23:08.120
I said

23:09.480 --> 23:10.840
I'd never push you away again.

23:12.320 --> 23:14.200
I want you to stay with me, always.

23:15.880 --> 23:17.760
When I tried to save Father
at Qingxiu Temple,

23:20.640 --> 23:22.960
I was relieved you didn't come.

23:23.800 --> 23:25.400
The place was full of perils.

23:26.840 --> 23:28.480
But once I was in real danger,

23:29.600 --> 23:30.360
I kept thinking…

23:33.640 --> 23:34.920
If I really died…

23:37.000 --> 23:38.480
Without even seeing you one last time,

23:39.680 --> 23:40.720
I would regret it so much.

23:43.560 --> 23:44.400
So this time…

23:47.200 --> 23:48.560
I won't push you away again.

23:49.560 --> 23:50.440
I'll hold on to you.

23:54.560 --> 23:55.520
I've fallen for you.

24:14.360 --> 24:14.960
Well then,

24:15.440 --> 24:17.320
since you're being so sincere about it,

24:18.040 --> 24:19.120
I don't mind forgiving you.

24:20.240 --> 24:21.360
But if you ever betray me,

24:22.080 --> 24:22.800
I'll make you pay.

24:29.800 --> 24:33.240
(Zhilan Palace)

24:34.040 --> 24:35.080
Prince Wuxia, this way.

24:41.600 --> 24:42.200
Consort Lan.

24:43.360 --> 24:44.120
Wuxia, you're here.

24:44.440 --> 24:45.160
Come, sit down.

24:45.920 --> 24:47.000
Father summoned me.

24:47.400 --> 24:49.080
I won't keep Your Highness any longer.

24:49.680 --> 24:50.640
Where is Father?

24:53.680 --> 24:54.960
His Majesty is resting.

24:55.280 --> 24:56.360
He asked me to welcome you.

24:57.080 --> 24:57.680
Have a seat.

25:07.400 --> 25:09.480
Here, try these snacks.

25:13.520 --> 25:15.720
How is Father doing lately?

25:17.400 --> 25:19.240
After taking the imperial
physician's medicine,

25:19.720 --> 25:21.960
his addiction to the pills
has eased quite a bit.

25:22.520 --> 25:24.440
But his body isn't what it used to be.

25:24.800 --> 25:26.120
Still, it's kind of you to care.

25:26.880 --> 25:28.640
No wonder he always
speaks so highly of you.

25:31.400 --> 25:32.440
Easing Father's burden

25:32.800 --> 25:34.000
is my duty as a son.

25:40.000 --> 25:40.880
Here, try this.

25:41.720 --> 25:43.320
It's a special recipe from my family.

25:49.640 --> 25:50.240
How is it?

25:53.200 --> 25:53.920
It's wonderful.

25:54.040 --> 25:54.640
Look at you.

25:55.360 --> 25:57.080
You're eating like a kid.

26:02.960 --> 26:04.080
Don't take it the wrong way.

26:05.200 --> 26:06.520
I just feel pity for you.

26:07.200 --> 26:08.600
You grew up without a mother's care.

26:09.200 --> 26:10.320
And your mother's family…

26:11.360 --> 26:13.680
Though mine isn't as powerful
as the three great families,

26:14.440 --> 26:16.120
we're still a noble house
of good standing.

26:18.840 --> 26:20.160
If I were to have a son,

26:21.720 --> 26:23.440
his birth would not be beneath him.

26:26.200 --> 26:27.480
Consort Lan, are you…

26:31.600 --> 26:32.520
Just some idle chatter.

26:34.320 --> 26:35.320
It's about time.

26:35.680 --> 26:37.400
I should go prepare
His Majesty's medicine.

26:38.920 --> 26:39.600
From now on,

26:40.640 --> 26:41.960
do come visit me more often.

26:50.040 --> 26:50.920
I'll take my leave.

27:01.080 --> 27:04.480
(Shen Residence)

27:06.680 --> 27:07.280
Father.

27:07.920 --> 27:08.520
Mother.

27:09.400 --> 27:11.000
Meng Zhongyan committed
countless crimes.

27:11.920 --> 27:13.040
He is now imprisoned.

27:14.400 --> 27:15.120
I should have

27:15.360 --> 27:17.120
pushed for a retrial
of the witchcraft case.

27:18.680 --> 27:19.440
But Taohua…

27:25.320 --> 27:27.480
If she doesn't return to Beiyuan
to find a cure,

27:28.520 --> 27:29.960
she might not have much time left.

27:32.680 --> 27:33.560
Please don't worry.

27:35.240 --> 27:36.080
Once I return,

27:36.920 --> 27:37.920
I will reopen the case

27:39.160 --> 27:40.400
and clear the Xie family's name.

28:05.760 --> 28:06.360
Chancellor.

28:08.600 --> 28:09.480
Prince Wuxia is here.

28:11.880 --> 28:12.600
Give me a moment.

28:20.360 --> 28:20.960
Wuxia.

28:21.480 --> 28:23.400
I've decided to go with Taohua tomorrow

28:23.520 --> 28:24.520
and head to Beiyuan.

28:25.800 --> 28:26.400
Once I return,

28:26.600 --> 28:27.480
I'll bring justice

28:28.120 --> 28:28.720
for Aunt

28:29.080 --> 28:29.920
and the Xie family.

28:33.040 --> 28:34.000
Did something happen?

28:36.920 --> 28:38.920
Father summoned me to the palace.

28:39.840 --> 28:41.200
It was Consort Lan who received me.

28:42.400 --> 28:45.760
In her words, she hinted
that her family holds great influence.

28:46.400 --> 28:47.960
And if she were to have a son,

28:48.680 --> 28:50.000
he'd be worthy of noble standing.

28:52.720 --> 28:55.160
His Majesty plans to have you adopted
under Consort Lan's name.

28:57.760 --> 28:59.080
If that happens,

28:59.560 --> 29:00.680
my mother, Consort Shu,

29:00.920 --> 29:02.680
will be erased from the records.

29:03.080 --> 29:04.080
She'll cease to exist

29:05.040 --> 29:06.240
in any records.

29:08.200 --> 29:09.520
If His Majesty wants you as heir,

29:10.840 --> 29:12.600
he must first craft you
a respectable lineage.

29:14.480 --> 29:16.800
We can't delay reopening
the witchcraft case.

29:22.440 --> 29:23.040
Zaiye.

29:23.880 --> 29:25.240
You should go with her to Beiyuan.

29:25.640 --> 29:26.640
I can manage things here.

29:27.880 --> 29:29.120
The die has been cast.

29:29.360 --> 29:30.360
There's no turning back.

29:31.440 --> 29:32.400
As for the Princess…

29:32.920 --> 29:33.520
Don't worry.

29:34.280 --> 29:34.920
Taohua will be

29:35.320 --> 29:36.120
well taken care of.

29:38.160 --> 29:38.760
Alright.

29:40.400 --> 29:41.000
Zaiye.

29:41.640 --> 29:42.680
We are brothers in arms.

29:43.160 --> 29:44.040
We fight side by side.

29:44.720 --> 29:46.640
The truth will be brought to light.

29:55.920 --> 29:56.880
(Meng Residence)

29:56.960 --> 29:57.560
Move!

29:58.280 --> 29:58.880
Hurry!

29:59.760 --> 30:00.400
Out of the way!

30:01.440 --> 30:02.040
Move aside!

30:02.440 --> 30:03.160
Go!

30:05.880 --> 30:06.480
Keep up!

30:07.160 --> 30:07.760
Go!

30:07.840 --> 30:08.440
Move!

30:09.920 --> 30:10.520
Step aside!

30:11.080 --> 30:12.080
By order of His Majesty,

30:12.480 --> 30:13.920
search and seize the Xie Residence!

30:14.400 --> 30:17.440
Xie Guanyu and Consort Shu
plotted the witchcraft case.

30:17.840 --> 30:18.880
That is treason!

30:19.800 --> 30:20.840
They have been convicted.

30:21.640 --> 30:23.560
The entire Xie family shall be executed.

30:25.240 --> 30:26.840
Don't let a single one of them escape!

30:26.920 --> 30:27.840
- Yes, sir!
- Yes, sir!

30:54.120 --> 30:55.520
Chancellor, we searched everywhere.

30:55.880 --> 30:56.760
No confession letter.

30:58.080 --> 30:58.680
Search again.

30:59.000 --> 30:59.600
Yes.

31:09.320 --> 31:09.920
Ms. Meng.

31:10.720 --> 31:11.520
Are you packed?

31:12.560 --> 31:14.280
The Meng family's assets
have been seized.

31:15.040 --> 31:16.600
There's really not much left to pack.

31:18.320 --> 31:20.120
Besides, the exile route
is long and rough.

31:20.880 --> 31:21.760
Traveling light

31:22.680 --> 31:23.520
might be better.

31:26.080 --> 31:27.520
What if I could spare
the women and children

31:28.520 --> 31:29.520
from exile?

31:46.800 --> 31:50.320
(Imperial Prison)

31:54.640 --> 31:55.240
Master Meng.

31:55.920 --> 31:56.840
Alive and well, I see.

32:07.400 --> 32:08.680
Now that you see me

32:10.600 --> 32:12.720
brought down to this disgraceful state,

32:14.080 --> 32:15.640
you must be pleased, Chancellor Shen.

32:18.520 --> 32:19.320
Pleased? Not quite.

32:20.520 --> 32:21.600
Just a little relieved.

32:27.480 --> 32:28.080
Master Meng.

32:28.680 --> 32:31.040
Do you still remember Xie Guanyu
of the Xie family?

32:33.680 --> 32:35.240
Why bring that up now?

32:37.440 --> 32:38.720
Thanks to you, Master Meng,

32:39.720 --> 32:40.640
the Xie family

32:41.360 --> 32:43.680
was wiped out.

32:44.680 --> 32:45.280
Now,

32:46.080 --> 32:47.400
justice has come full circle.

32:50.560 --> 32:51.680
What's your connection

32:52.200 --> 32:53.080
to the Xie family?

32:55.680 --> 32:57.240
Before I became Shen Zaiye,

32:58.520 --> 32:59.640
I had another name.

33:01.080 --> 33:02.160
I was Xie Jing'an.

33:05.480 --> 33:06.960
You orchestrated the witchcraft case.

33:08.200 --> 33:09.960
You confiscated
my father's confession letter.

33:11.120 --> 33:12.320
You framed the Xie family

33:12.880 --> 33:13.880
and Consort Shu.

33:15.160 --> 33:16.520
You slaughtered my entire family.

33:17.120 --> 33:19.880
Meng Zhongyan, do you admit it now?

33:23.480 --> 33:24.080
Correct.

33:25.360 --> 33:26.520
It was me.

33:28.000 --> 33:29.200
So what if it was?

33:29.880 --> 33:30.680
The case was ordered

33:31.280 --> 33:32.440
by His Majesty himself.

33:32.800 --> 33:33.720
There was evidence.

33:35.480 --> 33:36.560
It's been eighteen years.

33:37.760 --> 33:39.520
That case is set in stone.

33:39.960 --> 33:40.560
Not quite.

33:42.200 --> 33:43.760
With your confession in writing,

33:45.320 --> 33:46.520
the case can be reopened.

33:54.520 --> 33:57.040
I'm afraid I'll have to
disappoint you, Chancellor Shen.

34:01.120 --> 34:02.920
I've already committed treason.

34:03.920 --> 34:05.080
My entire family is guilty.

34:05.160 --> 34:06.240
We can't escape punishment.

34:08.320 --> 34:10.199
Why should I help you?

34:13.320 --> 34:14.639
Your entire family is guilty?

34:17.880 --> 34:19.600
Do you feel even a shred of regret

34:20.639 --> 34:22.320
for joining forces with Mu Wuyin

34:22.960 --> 34:24.520
and dragging your family down with you?

34:24.960 --> 34:26.320
Of course I regret it.

34:26.880 --> 34:30.400
Not just for trusting Mu Wuyin,

34:31.080 --> 34:32.000
but even more so

34:32.679 --> 34:35.120
for not wiping you out
when I had the chance.

34:39.400 --> 34:40.520
Still so delusional.

34:43.080 --> 34:44.000
Fortunately,

34:45.040 --> 34:46.760
not everyone in your family is as blind.

34:51.040 --> 34:52.280
Aren't you the least bit curious

34:53.040 --> 34:54.480
how the gates opened

34:55.679 --> 34:57.440
when we stormed the palace that day?

35:00.880 --> 35:02.240
It was Ms. Meng's doing.

35:03.520 --> 35:04.320
Because of that,

35:04.680 --> 35:05.920
her merits outweigh her crimes.

35:08.840 --> 35:09.440
By law,

35:10.160 --> 35:13.120
the women and children of the Meng family
can be spared execution.

35:14.040 --> 35:14.920
But your punishment

35:16.680 --> 35:18.280
shall be mine to decide.

35:19.120 --> 35:19.880
You mean

35:20.880 --> 35:23.080
Mu Wuyin failed to usurp
the throne in time

35:25.320 --> 35:27.760
because Meng Zhenzhen
let you into the palace?

35:30.680 --> 35:31.360
Impossible!

35:32.560 --> 35:33.400
That's impossible!

35:34.320 --> 35:34.920
Zhenzhen…

35:35.760 --> 35:37.400
Zhenzhen would never betray me!

35:37.680 --> 35:38.400
I want to see her!

35:38.800 --> 35:39.520
Now!

35:41.320 --> 35:41.920
Perfect.

35:42.720 --> 35:43.880
She wants to see you too.

35:53.520 --> 35:54.120
You tell him

35:54.800 --> 35:55.520
the rest.

36:15.480 --> 36:16.240
Was it you

36:17.520 --> 36:19.160
who gave the order to open the gates?

36:24.640 --> 36:25.240
Yes.

36:38.080 --> 36:39.320
We lost everything!

36:40.680 --> 36:41.880
It's all your fault!

36:42.720 --> 36:45.080
All my efforts went down the drain!

36:45.560 --> 36:46.840
You were captured early on.

36:47.000 --> 36:47.600
You had no idea

36:47.680 --> 36:49.320
Mu Wuyin was marrying
Empress Lv of Beiyuan

36:50.120 --> 36:51.320
instead of me.

36:52.160 --> 36:54.240
I almost died at the hands
of the maid he sent!

36:55.200 --> 36:56.880
Father, did you ever wonder why

36:56.960 --> 36:58.800
Mu Wuyin didn't let you
command the Palace Guards

36:58.880 --> 37:01.320
but instead sent you to watch
the Emperor at Qingxiu Temple?

37:01.800 --> 37:02.640
After the ceremony,

37:03.520 --> 37:05.560
what kind of fate did you think
awaited our family?

37:13.760 --> 37:14.680
And now…

37:17.000 --> 37:18.440
Look where the Meng family

37:19.840 --> 37:21.440
has ended up.

37:26.800 --> 37:27.800
Centuries ago,

37:29.120 --> 37:30.080
our ancestors

37:30.280 --> 37:31.520
started from nothing.

37:34.080 --> 37:35.120
And I'm still alive.

37:36.520 --> 37:38.520
The women and children
of our family will live on.

37:40.280 --> 37:42.760
The Meng family still has a future.

38:00.560 --> 38:01.560
Father, I beg you,

38:03.520 --> 38:04.720
for the future of our family,

38:05.920 --> 38:07.280
write the confession.

38:13.360 --> 38:14.720
To protect the Meng family,

38:20.280 --> 38:21.880
I'll pay whatever price it takes.

38:23.680 --> 38:27.000
(Meng Zhongyan confesses and
takes his own life in the prison cell)

38:48.160 --> 38:51.360
♪The flower bloomed,
knowing nothing at all♪

38:51.440 --> 38:54.480
♪In splendor, proud and tall♪

38:55.400 --> 38:58.520
♪The flower fell, lashed by the wind♪

38:58.640 --> 39:02.400
♪In a daze,
it felt like lifetimes had thinned♪

39:02.680 --> 39:05.760
♪Petals soaked in rain♪

39:05.880 --> 39:09.200
♪Heartbreak follows again and again♪

39:09.600 --> 39:13.160
♪The flower weeps, burdened by thoughts♪

39:13.240 --> 39:18.960
♪With no one it can be brought♪

39:23.920 --> 39:30.840
♪Wishes struggle through the mire♪

39:31.280 --> 39:38.120
♪Regrets clash in hopeless fire♪

39:38.600 --> 39:45.600
♪Still I hope she'll pick the flower
kissed by dew♪

39:45.920 --> 39:49.960
♪Even if it means this flower♪

39:50.080 --> 39:57.040
♪Will be hers to give to someone new♪

40:08.160 --> 40:11.280
♪Whose eyes
did the flower's heart meet?♪

40:11.360 --> 40:14.600
♪Love and hate held back, discreet♪

40:14.960 --> 40:18.640
♪The flower withers, feelings in decay♪

40:18.760 --> 40:25.320
♪No longer needing to say♪

40:29.400 --> 40:36.320
♪Yet I still long for her in madness♪

40:36.720 --> 40:43.680
♪Unafraid of judgment or sadness♪

40:44.040 --> 40:51.040
♪Remembering the words
she spoke of flowers and skies♪

40:51.400 --> 40:53.080
♪And finding♪

40:53.160 --> 41:00.160
♪They were her gentle heart's reply♪
